  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bsLMC0T.png\" alt=\"ㅤㅤㅤ\"></p>\n<h1>冬季 GUI 套件：Java 版</h1>\n<p><strong>Winter GUI</strong> 套件以柔和且富有氛圍的冬季主題，為 Minecraft 介面帶來全新面貌。輕柔的雪景裝飾、細膩的冰晶高光與溫馨的節慶細節，為選單與物品欄增添節日氣息，同時不破壞原版風格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iDtAFvQ.png\" alt=\"ㅤㅤㅤ\"></p>\n<h2>本套件更新項目：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>主選單</li>\n<li>按鈕與介面元素</li>\n<li>物品欄與容器畫面</li>\n<li>懸停與選取效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有設計皆以舒適、簡潔且護眼為目標，無論是單人世界還是伺服器都完美適配。</p>\n<p><strong>歡迎隨時分享您的反饋！也歡迎熱心協助者加入 :)</strong></p>\n<h2>支持我並獲取專屬獎勵 :3</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/RainbowLemur?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bg3GuyT.png\" alt=\"img\"></a></p>\n<h3>聯繫方式：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fNo-Lavishness-4629%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WrSkMRg.png\" alt=\"img\"></a>ㅤ<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fusers%252f691722335081857115%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UAtT6SQ.png\" alt=\"img\"></a>ㅤ<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fstatuettepauldurov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TP3shAi.png\" alt=\"img\"></a></p>",
